   "level": "FAIL",
   "id": "headline-lines",
   "width": 1440,
   "message": "2 headline(s) wrap past two lines at 1440px: \"I didn’t set out to build an app. I set out to u\" → 3 lines (15 words, 56px); \"Your money has a story. Make it one you understa\" → 3 lines (10 words, 80px)",
   "fix": "Cut words first (a headline is a title, not a sentence). Then give it a wider measure. Lower the size only as a last resort and never below the scale you chose. A real statement paragraph belongs in a <p> or <blockquote> at 36px or less."
